			"notes": "## Added\n\n- New config: `fossilsEnabled` toggle. This removes fossils from JER, JEI, the creative tab, and stops fossil drops.\n- Added a new tag for creative speleothems: `worldofstone:creative_speleothem`, and a new config toggle for them: `creativeSpeleothemsEnabled`.\n- Added missing tags to cracked bricks, chiseled bricks, infested blocks, button, sand, and gravel. Now if infested blocks are disabled, they are also removed from JEI.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Made it so that disabling stone replacement worldgen also removes every item with the new tag `#worldofstone:stone_variants`, which is a combined tag of `#igneous`, `#metamorphic`, and `#sedimentary`. These items are also hidden in creative and JEI/JER.\n- If nether or end ore generation is off, they are removed from JEI/JER and the creative tab.\n- If obsidian ore variants, snowed variants, overgrown variants, vanilla ore variants, or speleothems are off, they are removed from JEI/JER and the creative tab.\n- If stone replacement is off, Lignite Coal is fully removed.\n- Config toggles now re-apply on `/reload`.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- Mason trades are now gated on stone replacement. Earlier, if stone replacement was disabled, Masons could trade blank/missing items."
		},
