			"notes": "v1.1.0\n\nAdded:\nNether Ore Multiplier Config.\nEnd Ore Multiplier Config.\n\nChanges:\nNether and End ore generation nerfed significantly to match vanilla's ore generation better.\n\nBug Fixes:\nJER fixes for all Nether, End, and Obsidian ore variants.\nJER ore display is now syned to the config.\nJER mixin uses VanillaOreHost.HostDimension enum now instead of hardcoded host name strings.\n\nOther:\nFixed some small code inconsistencies.\nUpdated deprecated code.\nAdded more names to mod credit."
